{"id":"nave:david","source":"nave","name":"David","slug":"david","seeAlso":["Cabinet"],"entries":[{"text":"Genealogy of Ru 4:18-22; 1Sa 16:11; 17:12; 1Ch 2:3-15; Mt 1:1-6; Lu 3:31-38","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ruth",4,18,4,22],["1Sam",16,11,16,11],["1Sam",17,12,17,12],["1Chr",2,3,2,15],["Matt",1,1,1,6],["Luke",3,31,3,38]]},{"text":"A shepherd 1Sa 16:11","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",16,11,16,11]]},{"text":"Kills a lion and a bear 1Sa 17:34-36","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",17,34,17,36]]},{"text":"Anointed king, while a youth, by the prophet Samuel, and inspired 1Sa 16:1,13; Ps 89:19-37","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",16,1,16,1],["1Sam",16,13,16,13],["Ps",89,19,89,37]]},{"text":"Chosen of God Ps 78:70","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",78,70,78,70]]},{"text":"Described to Saul 1Sa 16:18","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",16,18,16,18]]},{"text":"Detailed as armor-bearer and musician at Saul’s court 1Sa 16:21-23","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",16,21,16,23]]},{"text":"Kills Goliath 1Sa 17","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",17,0,17,0]]},{"text":"The love of Jonathan for 1Sa 18:1-4","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",18,1,18,4]]},{"text":"Popularity and discreetness of 1Sa 18","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",18,0,18,0]]},{"text":"Saul’s jealousy of 1Sa 18:8-30","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",18,8,18,30]]},{"text":"Is defrauded of Merab, and given Michal to marry 1Sa 18:17-27","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",18,17,18,27]]},{"text":"Jonathan intercedes for 1Sa 19:1-7","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",19,1,19,7]]},{"text":"Probably writes Psalms Eleven at this period of his life Ps 17; 35; 52; 58; 64; 109;","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",17,0,17,0],["Ps",35,0,35,0],["Ps",52,0,52,0],["Ps",58,0,58,0],["Ps",64,0,64,0],["Ps",109,0,109,0]]},{"text":"Conducts a campaign against, and defeats the Philistines 1Sa 19:8","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",19,8,19,8]]},{"text":"Saul attempts to kill him; he escapes to Ramah, and lives at Naioth, where Saul pursues him 1Sa 19:9-24","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",19,9,19,24]]},{"text":"About this time writes Ps 59","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",59,0,59,0]]},{"text":"Returns, and Jonathan makes covenant with him 1Sa 20","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",20,0,20,0]]},{"text":"Escapes by way of Nob, where he obtains shewbread and Goliath’s sword from Abimelech 1Sa 21:1-6; Mt 12:3,4","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",21,1,21,6],["Matt",12,3,12,3],["Matt",12,4,12,4]]},{"text":"Escapes to Gath 1Sa 21:10-15","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",21,10,21,15]]},{"text":"At this time probably writes Ps 34; 35; 52; 56; 120","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",34,0,34,0],["Ps",35,0,35,0],["Ps",52,0,52,0],["Ps",56,0,56,0],["Ps",120,0,120,0]]},{"text":"Recruits an army of insurgents, goes to Moab, returns to Hareth 1Sa 22","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",22,0,22,0]]},{"text":"Probably writes Ps 13","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",13,0,13,0]]},{"text":"Saves Keilah 1Sa 23:1-13","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",23,1,23,13]]},{"text":"Makes second covenant with Jonathan 1Sa 23:16-18","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",23,16,23,18]]},{"text":"Goes to the wilderness of Ziph, is betrayed to Saul 1Sa 23:13-26","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",23,13,23,26]]},{"text":"Writes a psalm on the betrayal Ps 54","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",54,0,54,0]]},{"text":"And probably Ps 22; 31; 34; 140","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",22,0,22,0],["Ps",31,0,31,0],["Ps",34,0,34,0],["Ps",140,0,140,0]]},{"text":"Saul is diverted from pursuit of 1Sa 23:27,28","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",23,27,23,27],["1Sam",23,28,23,28]]},{"text":"At this time probably writes Ps 12; 22","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",12,0,12,0],["Ps",22,0,22,0]]},{"text":"Goes to En-gedi 1Sa 23:29","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",23,29,23,29]]},{"text":"Refrains from killing Saul 1Sa 24","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",24,0,24,0]]},{"text":"Writes Ps 57","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",57,0,57,0]]},{"text":"Covenants with Saul 1Sa 26","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",26,0,26,0]]},{"text":"Marries Nabal’s widow, Abigail, and Ahinoam 1Sa 25","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",25,0,25,0]]},{"text":"Lives in the wilderness of Ziph, has opportunity to kill Saul, but only takes his spear; Saul is contrite 1Sa 26","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",26,0,26,0]]},{"text":"Flees to Achish and lives in Ziklag 1Sa 27","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",27,0,27,0]]},{"text":"The list of men who join him 1Ch 12:1-22","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Chr",12,1,12,22]]},{"text":"Conducts an expedition against Amalekites, misstates the facts to Achish 1Sa 27:8-12","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",27,8,27,12]]},{"text":"At this time probably writes Ps 141","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",141,0,141,0]]},{"text":"Is refused permission to accompany the Philistines to battle against the Israelites 1Sa 28:1,2; 29","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",28,1,28,1],["1Sam",28,2,28,2],["1Sam",29,0,29,0]]},{"text":"Rescues the people of Ziklag, who had been captured by the Amalekites 1Sa 30","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",30,0,30,0]]},{"text":"Probably writes Ps 18; 20; 21","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",18,0,18,0],["Ps",20,0,20,0],["Ps",21,0,21,0]]},{"text":"Death and burial of Saul and his sons 1Sa 31; 2Sa 21:1-14","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",31,0,31,0],["2Sam",21,1,21,14]]},{"text":"Kills the murderer of Saul 2Sa 1:1-16","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",1,1,1,16]]},{"text":"Lamentation over Saul 2Sa 1:17-27","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",1,17,1,27]]},{"text":"After living for one year and four months at Ziklag 1Sa 27:7","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Sam",27,7,27,7]]},{"text":"David goes to Hebron, and is anointed king by Judah 2Sa 2:1-4,11; 5:5; 1Ki 2:11; 1Ch 3:4; 11:1-3","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",2,1,2,4],["2Sam",2,11,2,11],["2Sam",5,5,5,5],["1Kgs",2,11,2,11],["1Chr",3,4,3,4],["1Chr",11,1,11,3]]},{"text":"The list of those who join him at Hebron 1Ch 12:23-40","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Chr",12,23,12,40]]},{"text":"Ish-bosheth, son of Saul, crowned 2Sa 2:4","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"David wages war against and defeats Ish-bosheth 2Sa 2:13-32; 3:4","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",2,13,2,32],["2Sam",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Demands the restoration of Michal, his wife 2Sa 3:14-16","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",3,14,3,16]]},{"text":"Abner revolts from Ish-bosheth, and joins David, but is killed by Joab 2Sa 3","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",3,0,3,0]]},{"text":"Punishes Ish-bosheth’s murderers 2Sa 4","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",4,0,4,0]]},{"text":"Anointed king over all Israel, after reigning over Judah at Hebron for seven years and six months, and reigns thirty-three years 2Sa 2:11; 5:5; 1Ch 3:4; 11:1-3; 12:23-40; 29:27","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",2,11,2,11],["2Sam",5,5,5,5],["1Chr",3,4,3,4],["1Chr",11,1,11,3],["1Chr",12,23,12,40],["1Chr",29,27,29,27]]},{"text":"Makes conquest of Jerusalem 2Sa 5:6; 1Ch 11:4-8; Isa 29:1","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",5,6,5,6],["1Chr",11,4,11,8],["Isa",29,1,29,1]]},{"text":"Builds a palace 2Sa 5:11; 2Ch 2:3","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",5,11,5,11],["2Chr",2,3,2,3]]},{"text":"Friendship of, with Hiram, king of Tyre 2Sa 5:11; 1Ki 5:1","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",5,11,5,11],["1Kgs",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Prospered of God 2Sa 5:10; 1Ch 11:9","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",5,10,5,10],["1Chr",11,9,11,9]]},{"text":"Fame of 1Ch 14:17","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Chr",14,17,14,17]]},{"text":"Philistines make war against, and are defeated by him 2Sa 5:17,25","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",5,17,5,17],["2Sam",5,25,5,25]]},{"text":"Assembles thirty-thousand men to escort the ark of the covenant to Jerusalem with music and thanksgiving 2Sa 6:1-5","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",6,1,6,5]]},{"text":"Uzzah is struck down when he attempts to steady the ark of the covenant 2Sa 6:6-11","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",6,6,6,11]]},{"text":"David is terrified, and leaves the ark at the house of Obed-edom 2Sa 6:9-11","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",6,9,6,11]]},{"text":"After three months, David brings the ark of the covenant to Jerusalem with dancing and great joy 2Sa 6:12-16; 1Ch 13","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",6,12,6,16],["1Chr",13,0,13,0]]},{"text":"Organized the tabernacle service 1Ch 9:22; 15:16-24; 16:4-6,37-43","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["1Chr",9,22,9,22],["1Chr",15,16,15,24],["1Chr",16,4,16,6],["1Chr",16,37,16,43]]},{"text":"Offers sacrifice, distributes gifts, and blesses the people 2Sa 6:17-19","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",6,17,6,19]]},{"text":"Michal rebukes him for his religious enthusiasm 2Sa 6:20-23","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",6,20,6,23]]},{"text":"Desires to build a temple, is forbidden, but receives God’s promise that his seed should reign forever 2Sa 7:12-16; 23:5; 1Ch 17:11-14; 2Ch 6:16; Ps 89:3,4; 132:11,12; Ac 15:16; Ro 15:12","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",7,12,7,16],["2Sam",23,5,23,5],["1Chr",17,11,17,14],["2Chr",6,16,6,16],["Ps",89,3,89,3],["Ps",89,4,89,4],["Ps",132,11,132,11],["Ps",132,12,132,12],["Acts",15,16,15,16],["Rom",15,12,15,12]]},{"text":"Interpretation and fulfillment of this prophecy Ac 13:22,23","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Acts",13,22,13,22],["Acts",13,23,13,23]]},{"text":"At this time, probably, David writes Ps 15; 16; 24; 101; 138","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",15,0,15,0],["Ps",16,0,16,0],["Ps",24,0,24,0],["Ps",101,0,101,0],["Ps",138,0,138,0]]},{"text":"Conquers the Philistines, Moabites, and Syria 2Sa 8","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",8,0,8,0]]},{"text":"Treats Mephibosheth, the lame son of Saul, with great kindness 2Sa 9:6; 19:24-30","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",9,6,9,6],["2Sam",19,24,19,30]]},{"text":"Sends commissioners with a message of sympathy to Hanun, son of the king of Ammon; the message is misinterpreted, and commissioners treated with indignity; David retaliates by invading, and defeats the combined armies of the Ammonites and Syrians 2Sa 10; 1Ch 19","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",10,0,10,0],["1Chr",19,0,19,0]]},{"text":"Probably writes Ps 18; 20; 21","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",18,0,18,0],["Ps",20,0,20,0],["Ps",21,0,21,0]]},{"text":"Commits adultery with Bath-sheba 2Sa 11:2-5","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",11,2,11,5]]},{"text":"Wickedly causes the death of Uriah 2Sa 11:6-25","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",11,6,11,25]]},{"text":"Takes Bath-sheba to be his wife 2Sa 11:26,27","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",11,26,11,26],["2Sam",11,27,11,27]]},{"text":"Is rebuked by the prophet Nathan 2Sa 12:1-14","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",12,1,12,14]]},{"text":"Repents of his crime and confesses his guilt Ps 6; 32; 38; 39; 40; 51","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",6,0,6,0],["Ps",32,0,32,0],["Ps",38,0,38,0],["Ps",39,0,39,0],["Ps",40,0,40,0],["Ps",51,0,51,0]]},{"text":"Is chastised with grievous affliction on account of his crime Ps 38; 41; 69","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",38,0,38,0],["Ps",41,0,41,0],["Ps",69,0,69,0]]},{"text":"Death of his infant son (born from Bath-sheba) 2Sa 12:15-23","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",12,15,12,23]]},{"text":"Solomon is born to 2Sa 12:24,25","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",12,24,12,24],["2Sam",12,25,12,25]]},{"text":"Ammonites defeated and tortured 2Sa 12:26-31","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",12,26,12,31]]},{"text":"Amnon’s crime, his murder by Absalom, and Absalom’s flight 2Sa 13","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",13,0,13,0]]},{"text":"Absalom’s return 2Sa 14:1-24","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",14,1,14,24]]},{"text":"Absalom’s usurpation 2Sa 14; 15","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",14,0,14,0],["2Sam",15,0,15,0]]},{"text":"David’s flight from Jerusalem 2Sa 15:13-37","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",15,13,15,37]]},{"text":"He probably writes, at this time Ps 5; 7; 26; 61; 63; 69; 70; 86; 143","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["Ps",5,0,5,0],["Ps",7,0,7,0],["Ps",26,0,26,0],["Ps",61,0,61,0],["Ps",63,0,63,0],["Ps",69,0,69,0],["Ps",70,0,70,0],["Ps",86,0,86,0],["Ps",143,0,143,0]]},{"text":"Shimei curses him 2Sa 16","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",16,0,16,0]]},{"text":"Crosses the Jordan River 2Sa 17:21-29","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",17,21,17,29]]},{"text":"Absalom’s defeat and death 2Sa 18","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",18,0,18,0]]},{"text":"Laments the death of Absalom 2Sa 18:33; 19:1-4","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",18,33,18,33],["2Sam",19,1,19,4]]},{"text":"Rebuked by Joab 2Sa 19:5-7","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",19,5,19,7]]},{"text":"David rebukes the priests for not showing loyalty amid the complaints of the people against him 2Sa 19:9-15","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",19,9,19,15]]},{"text":"Shimei begs for clemency 2Sa 19:16-23","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",19,16,19,23]]},{"text":"Mephibosheth begs for the king’s favor 2Sa 19:24-30","group":["1. King of Israel"],"refs":[["2Sam",19,24,19,30]]},{"text":